{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Anything: Zombie Invaders</strong> is a wild action defense game where chaos never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack it, smash it, and survive against endless waves of zombies in a hilarious physics-based showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to play, hard to master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls let anyone jump right in, but clever tactics and quick reactions are the key to survival.<br>\ud83e\udddf <strong>Endless mayhem</strong> \u2013 Hurl everything you see, from everyday objects to crazy weapons, at incoming zombies.<br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Chapter finales</strong> \u2013 Each chapter ends with a boss encounter that raises the tension and delivers a satisfying climax.<br>\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Casual but thrilling</strong> \u2013 Perfect for players who love fast-paced action with a touch of comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual gamer looking for quick fun or a mid-core player chasing high scores, <strong>Pancake Mayhem is here to deliver nonstop chaos and laughter!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956660?t=1760101632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/f245af8056de7de4d3cb15a00a3741c8407a6d8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760101632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/0ecc8bc0f9c9a8a52c5d3de4c236e80cbee84452/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760101632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/0ecc8bc0f9c9a8a52c5d3de4c236e80cbee84452/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760101632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Anything: Zombie Invaders</strong> is a wild action defense game where chaos never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack it, smash it, and survive against endless waves of zombies in a hilarious physics-based showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to play, hard to master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls let anyone jump right in, but clever tactics and quick reactions are the key to survival.<br>\ud83e\udddf <strong>Endless mayhem</strong> \u2013 Hurl everything you see, from everyday objects to crazy weapons, at incoming zombies.<br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Chapter finales</strong> \u2013 Each chapter ends with a boss encounter that raises the tension and delivers a satisfying climax.<br>\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Casual but thrilling</strong> \u2013 Perfect for players who love fast-paced action with a touch of comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual gamer looking for quick fun or a mid-core player chasing high scores, <strong>Pancake Mayhem is here to deliver nonstop chaos and laughter!</strong></p>","developers":["Visual Light"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956660/1d17327d933baa49a6f72985bad9d41b7418c7c0/header.jpg?t=1760101632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3956660/539564404/199c38185b3fa5ea40e68d8c77550dc521ec70f3/1760100554/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760101630","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3956660/539564404/199c38185b3fa5ea40e68d8c77550dc521ec70f3/1760100554/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760101630","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3956660/539564404/199c38185b3fa5ea40e68d8c77550dc521ec70f3/1760100554/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760101630","id":257185845,"mp4":{"4